        # 1) i is last of ri and j is first of rj => ri + rj
        # 2) i is first of ri and j is first of rj => reverse ri, then ri + rj
        # 3) i is last of ri and j is last of rj => reverse rj, then ri + rj
        # 4) i is first of ri and j is last of rj => reverse both
